# Copy to .env for local dev. Base URL must include /api (see server/host.json routePrefix).
VITE_AZURE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:7071/api

# Optional: seed mock data into Cosmos (npm run seed). Overrides VITE_ for that command only.
# SEED_API_BASE_URL=https://sank-gr.azurewebsites.net/api

# Production builds (`npm run build`) load `.env.production` (committed) with the live API host.
# After you deploy the SPA (e.g. Azure Static Web Apps), add that site URL under your Function App:
# Azure Portal → sank-gr (Function App) → API → CORS → Allowed Origins (include your SWA URL and http://localhost:5173 for dev).

# Azure Cosmos DB: database id SankuCRM. Containers used by this app (partition key /id on each):
